    <IRS990ScheduleO documentId="IRS990ScheduleO-01" softwareId="24020153">
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Pt VI, Line 4</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>IN SEPTEMBER OF 2024, CHANGES TO THE BYLAWS INCLUDED FORMALLY ESTABLISHING AN EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE CHARGED WITH THE ADMINISTRATIVE GOVERNANCE OF THE ORGANIZATION AND WITH A MANDATORY FUNDRAISING COMMITMENT LEVEL FOR EACH OF ITS MEMBERS. ALL OTHER MEMBERS OF THE BOARD ARE ASSIGNED TO A FORMALLY ESTABLISHED NATIONAL SECURITY POLICY COMMITTEE, INTENDED TO GUIDE THE POLICY AND RESEARCH DIRECTION OF THE ORGANIZATION WHILE PROVIDING SUPERVISORY AUTHORITY OVER THE EXECUTIVE COMMITTEES FUNDRAISING ACTIVITIES. A PROVISION WAS ESTABLISHED TO ALLOW THE COMPENSATION OF BOARD MEMBERS ACTING AS CONSULTANTS TO THE ORGANIZATION, IF GRANTED APPROVAL BY THE BOARD.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Pt VI, Line 11b</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATIONS MANAGEMENT REVIEWS FORM 990 PRIOR TO FILNG WITH THE IRS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Pt VI, Line 12c</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>DIRECTORS AND OFFICERS ARE REQUIRED TO REPORT TO THE BOARD ANY FINANCIAL INTEREST WHICH THE OFFICER OR DIRECTOR DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY HAS IN ANY PERSON OR ENTITY WHICH IS A PARTY TO A TRANSACTION UNDER CONSIDERATION BY THE BOARD. THE INTERESTED DIRECTOR OR OFFICER IS REQUIRED TO ABSTAIN FROM VOTING ON THE TRANSACTION.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Pt VI, Line 15a</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATIONS INDEPENDENT GOVERNING BODY APPROVES THE ANNUAL BUDGET, WHICH INCLUDES COMPENSATION OF THE CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
      <SupplementalInformationDetail>
        <FormAndLineReferenceDesc>Pt VI, Line 15b</FormAndLineReferenceDesc>
        <ExplanationTxt>THE ORGANIZATIONS INDEPENDENT GOVERNING BODY APPROVES THE ANNUAL BUDGET, WHICH INCLUDES COMPENSATION OF OTHER OFFICERS.</ExplanationTxt>
      </SupplementalInformationDetail>
